# --- Secrets and local state: never commit these ---
# accounts.json holds Google OAuth refresh tokens; the SQLite database holds client API
# key hashes plus traffic audit metadata (model, status, token counts, error message).
# Request/response bodies are NOT persisted by the audit layer.
